Description: DeeDee is a collection of functions to compare the results of two 
    or more Differential Expression Analyses. From data preparation to different
    forms of graphic output, DeeDee has your back. Aside from the standalone
    functions, the package contains a Shiny App that contains the package's full 
    functionality and more.
